    "revision": 1,
    "title": "Speaking and interaction practice",
    "subtitle": "Two places with similar names · 2",
    "context": "Use the selected vocabulary and constructions to resolve a location misunderstanding using precise reference.",
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "EX-CORE-U3-11-required-speaking-produce",
        "kind": "check",
        "title": "Explain the situation",
        "questions": [
          {
            "id": "EX-CORE-U3-11-required-speaking-draft",
            "kind": "production",
            "response": "spoken",
            "prompt": "Two places with similar names · 2: Explain the practical problem and your proposed response to an absent partner. State one constraint or condition and explain how it changes the plan.",
            "promptLanguage": "en",
            "context": "我坐车去一个城市找同学，他让我到学校附近的书店等他。我记得以前学校旁边只有一家饭店，没有书店，不知道现在该去哪里。\n\n我打电话问同学，他告诉我，那家饭店已经变成书店，门口还在以前那条路上。我这才知道该去哪个地方，请他再说下去，告诉我怎么走。\n\n同学说他还有工作，让我先进去看书。我从学校门口走过去，看见书店里面有很多书，门旁边有几张桌子，可以坐下看。\n\n同学来时，我正在门旁边看书，他问我是不是很难找。我说，知道饭店已经变成书店以后，就找到了地方，因为门口那条路还和以前一样。\n\n我们买了一本写这个城市的书，一起走出书店。以前在这里吃饭，现在在这里看书。我发现记得一个地方，也要知道它后来变成了什么。",
            "contextLanguage": "zh",
            "label": "Take your speaking turn",
            "resultDomain": "Self-reviewed speaking practice",
            "rubric": [
              {
                "id": "r1",
                "text": "My problem and proposed response follow the source."
              },
              {
                "id": "r2",
                "text": "I connected a real condition or constraint to the result."
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "sequential": true
      }
    ],
